## Anatomy

<CodeBlock code={anatomy} filename="App.svelte" />

## API reference

### ContextMenu.Trigger

<ApiTable props={triggerProps} />

`ContextMenu.Root` is the dropdown-menu root carrying cursor-anchor state; `Content`, `Item`, `Separator`, `CheckboxItem`, `RadioGroup`, submenus, and `Portal` are the menu engine re-exported unchanged. See [Dropdown Menu](/dropdown-menu) for their props.

## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>↑</Kbd><Kbd>↓</Kbd> move focus and highlight once open; <Kbd>Home</Kbd> / <Kbd>End</Kbd> jump; type to search.
- <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> / <Kbd>Space</Kbd> selects; <Kbd>Esc</Kbd> closes; <Kbd>Tab</Kbd> dismisses.
- A left press inside the trigger area dismisses an open menu.
